sentences.t:
Vix haec ediderat, cum effusis imbribus atra
tempestas sine more furit, tonitruque tremescunt
ardua terrarum et campi;

sentences.l:
Scarcely these things had he uttered, when with poured-out rains black
a tempest without measure rages, and with thunder tremble
the steep places of the lands and the plains;
